        "metadata": {
          "media": {
            "duration": 2610,
            "fileSize": 25780960
          },
          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Welcome to the Kingdom of Bean, where life is peaceful, the people are kind and Princess Catherine is known for her big heart, beautiful singing voice and very strong opinions about waking up early. Her favorite companion is Finnola, a fluffy little fox who follows her everywhere.But one morning, Catherine’s singing reaches a grumpy witch who has had quite enough of being woken up. She decides to cast a spell on the princess, but her rusty magic misses its target and hits Finnola instead. Suddenly, the little fox can’t yip anymore… she can only CROAK!What follows is a funny fairy-tale adventure filled with magic, mishaps and plenty of personality as Catherine tries to figure out what happened to her best friend. Along the way, she also has to face something almost as tricky as a witch’s spell: her own temper.With a quirky kingdom, a not-so-great witch and one very froggy fox, this story mixes humor and adventure with a sweet message about slowing down, listening to others and having the courage to make things right.Run Time: 43 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 897e06ab9fa98f13b8f7a8527ba4cf2856d903148f82514a5b21324add73e779",
